B.Nt=new A.r("newwill","Unsigned New Will","mbedroom",0,"Locked in her bedside cabinet, a draft to be signed today: \u201cI revoke all bequests to my niece Tira Misu. My butler, G. Cracker, is dismissed without pension. Both know why. Everything goes to the Donut County Home for Day-Old Pastries.\u201d",B.aR,B.m,"cabinet",B.f,B.b,!1,null)
