B.Oh=new A.r("solicitor","Solicitor's Letter","entrance",3,"On the mat under the letterbox, opened and re-folded: \u201cMadam, as instructed, the new will disinheriting Miss Misu and dismissing Mr. Cracker without pension is ready. I shall bring it for your signature tomorrow at ten. \u2014 Crumble & Crumble.\u201d",B.aB,B.u,null,B.fT,B.TQ,!1,null)
