B.Nk=new A.r("retire","Letter to an Agency","mbedroom",2,"On Mrs. Senclair's pillow, ready to post: \u201cPlease send a modern housekeeper at once. The present one, P. Cotta, is to be retired without notice or pension. She makes the same puddings she made thirty years ago.\u201d",B.aB,B.u,null,B.fT,B.Yo,!1,null)
