B.a4F=new A.ar(B.a79,["Splendid. Now all we want is the weapon.",u.h,u.S,u.X,u.Q,u.Q,u.y,u.B,"Everybody else's alibi is somebody's word. This one is a pudding. Can a pudding lie, Churlock?","Somebody lifted that down who knew just where it was kept. Mind you, in this house, that is everyone.","No gaps at all, and each man watching the other. Can anyone outside that room say the same of them?","Timing, Churlock. When did that get there? Officer Glaze handled the body. Ask him.","Timing, Churlock. When did that get there? Officer Glaze knows how such things dry. Ask him.","A souffl\xe9 takes eggs. Count them again. Then ask her where hers came from.","Cold, and the coal untouched. Barry fills that scuttle. Ask him how much an hour's baking burns.","Thirty years is a long time to be owed. But she had waited thirty years already. Why last night, of all nights?","So that is what was coming. The question is whether the housekeeper knew it was coming.","Tell her after breakfast. So today was to be the day. Did she know?",u.f,u.f,"Out in the yard, and there is only one way into that yard. Whose room is it? I should dust it.","A shopping note. But notice what it says about the larder, Churlock.","Sharp, you say? Ask Officer Glaze how long a print stays sharp."],t.w)
B.ZG=s(["Start with the clock, Churlock. When did she die? And then: who can show where they were, with something better than their own say-so?","The chess players vouch for each other, which is worth little, unless somebody else heard them. Ask Miss Tira what came up the stairs while she was on the telephone.","That leaves one alibi which is not a person at all. Go back to the kitchen. Look at the oven, the eggs, the coal. Ask Barry what he saw through the window.","Now the cellar floor. Something was dropped there, and it matters very much when. Ask Officer Glaze. And read that oven log against the time of death."],t.s)
B.au5=new A.f("what","What happened to her?","Victim is Mrs. \xc9claire Senclair, founder of Senclair Confections. Struck from behind, once, with something heavy. She went down like a dropped tray. We traced where she fell in powdered sugar.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.avu=new A.f("weapon","What was the weapon?","Dense, blunt, about the size of a brick. We picked raisins and candied peel out of the, er, point of impact. Fruitcake, Detective. An old one. One dessert could swing it.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.XM=s([B.au5,B.avu,B.eD,B.de],t.q)
B.a2o=s(["underdrip"],t.s)
B.at9=new A.f("under","There was sauce underneath the body.","I noted that myself when we moved her. Whatever dripped there, dripped before she hit the floor, or as she did. Nobody slid it under her afterwards.",B.a2o,B.b,null)
B.Zy=s(["drydrip"],t.s)
B.au6=new A.f("dry","How long does berry sauce take to dry like that?","Fresh sauce stays tacky a couple of hours. That spot was bone dry and cracked when we arrived at seven, and the housekeeper says she only came down at half six.",B.Zy,B.b,null)
B.av0=new A.f("fresh","Would twelve-year-old fingerprints still be sharp?","After twelve years in a tin? They'd be dull as dust, Detective, if they came up at all. Sharp and greasy means fresh. Hours old, not years.",B.aa,B.b,null)
B.U0=s([B.iP,B.iS,B.iK,B.iM,B.iJ,B.at9,B.au6,B.av0],t.q)
B.a2p=s(["underdrip","drydrip"],t.s)
B.arM=new A.f("sauce","There is red berry sauce beside the body.","Well, of course it is. I told you \u2014 I went all to pieces when I found her this morning, and my topping runs when I'm upset.",B.a2p,B.b,null)
B.a2a=s(["tin"],t.s)
B.atC=new A.f("tin","The Christmas fruitcake is gone from its tin.","Gone? Twelve years that thing has sat up there. Madam wouldn't let me throw it out. Well, the pantry is never locked, Detective. Anybody could have reached it down.",B.a2a,B.b,null)
B.ZN=s(["eggs"],t.s)
B.asl=new A.f("eggs","All twelve of yesterday's eggs are still in the basket.","I used up last week's eggs first. Waste not, want not.",B.ZN,B.b,null)
B.tX=s(["ovenash"],t.s)
B.aty=new A.f("oven","Your oven is stone cold and the coal has not been touched.","I always sweep out the grate the moment I've finished baking. And I had coal left over from the day before. Habit, Detective.",B.tX,B.b,null)
B.Xg=s(["barry/window"],t.s)
B.avL=new A.f("window","Barry says the kitchen was empty at eleven.","Barry was half frozen and seeing things. I may have stepped into the scullery for sugar. For a moment.",B.b,B.Xg,null)
B.X2=s(["tira/smell"],t.s)
B.awz=new A.f("smell","Tira says there was no smell of baking last night.","Miss Tira had a telephone pressed to one side of her head and the Colonel's cigar up the other. I shouldn't rely on her nose.",B.b,B.X2,null)
B.a1E=s(["retire"],t.s)
B.avw=new A.f("retire","She was going to retire you without notice.","Was she? She said nothing to me. Thirty years, and the same puddings \u2014 well. They were good enough to build her a factory.",B.a1E,B.b,null)
B.auz=new A.f("prints","Your fingerprints are on the fruitcake.","My prints, on my own cake, from my own pantry? I baked the thing, Detective. I'd be more surprised if you'd found the Colonel's.",B.aa,B.b,null)
B.Nq=new A.r("ovenlog","Oven Log","",0,"Penny's oven log card for last night, in pencil: \u201cNeedy Souffl\xe9. IN 10:30. Basted every 2 min. 11:20 \u2014 Madam rang down to say it smelt divine. OUT 11:30. Risen four inches. Eggs: 6.\u201d",B.aR,B.u,null,B.f,B.b,!1,"penny")
B.auN=new A.f("log","May I see your oven log?",u.r,B.u6,B.b,B.Nq)
B.Vb=s([B.dz,B.FS,B.l6,B.arM,B.atC,B.asl,B.aty,B.avL,B.awz,B.avw,B.auz,B.auN,B.dq,B.dy,B.dx,B.dB,B.ds,B.dk,B.dG,B.dA],t.q)
B.at6=new A.f("where","Where were you around 11 last night?","In the parlor, sir, at chess with the Colonel, from half past ten until midnight. Neither of us left the board.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.atS=new A.f("sheet","Your scoresheet shows no breaks at all.","Every move timed and initialled by both players, sir. The Colonel insists upon it, as he believes that I cheat. I believe the same of him. It makes for an honest record.",B.d8,B.b,null)
B.VT=s(["penny/eggs"],t.s)
B.ash=new A.f("eggs","Would Penny bake with last week's eggs?","Mrs. Cotta, sir? Never. There were no eggs left from last week; I signed for the new dozen yesterday because the larder was bare. And she permits nothing but the freshest. She says a souffl\xe9 knows.",B.b,B.VT,null)
B.atE=new A.f("brandy","There is ricotta at the top of the cellar steps.","The Colonel fetched up his own brandy at eight o'clock, sir, rather than ring for me. I disapproved, and entered it in the cellar book.",B.nB,B.b,null)
B.We=s([B.at6,B.eG,B.iL,B.atS,B.ash,B.atE,B.dn,B.dr,B.dp,B.dD,B.dv,B.dl,B.dE,B.dC],t.q)
B.avn=new A.f("sheet","You initialled every move on Graham's scoresheet.","Had to, sir. The fellow moves his bishops when one blinks. Never took my eyes off him in an hour and a half. He'll tell you the same of me, the cheek of it.",B.d8,B.b,null)
B.ato=new A.f("drip","You left ricotta at the top of the cellar steps.","Went down for a decent brandy at eight, sir. Graham pours like a miser. \xc9claire was alive and well and telling me so at supper.",B.nB,B.b,null)
B.a1C=s(["regiment"],t.s)
B.asd=new A.f("regiment","Fort Fondant has never heard of you.","Not among the FIGHTING officers, no. I was a colonel in the Catering Corps, sir. Forty years of trifle for the troops. One doesn't advertise it. \xc9claire knew, and teased me rotten.",B.a1C,B.b,null)
B.a26=s([B.iR,B.FQ,B.p1,B.avn,B.ato,B.h3,B.h_,B.dg,B.dj,B.dh,B.eK,B.asd,B.l5],t.q)
B.awv=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Graham and the Colonel, darling, thick as thieves over that chessboard. Each one swears the other never moved. How convenient.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.avl=new A.f("check","Could the chess players have slipped out?","I only wish they had, darling. The Colonel bellowed \u201cCHECK!\u201d up the stairwell every few minutes the whole time I was on the telephone, and Graham sniffed after every one. It was like a metronome. Neither of them drew breath long enough to murder anyone.",B.b,B.i3,null)
B.tB=s(["penny/where"],t.s)
B.atP=new A.f("smell","Penny was baking a souffl\xe9 at that hour.","Was she? How odd. When Penny bakes, the whole stairwell reeks of it for hours. Last night I smelt nothing but the Colonel's cigar.",B.b,B.tB,null)
B.VG=s([B.fZ,B.eO,B.awv,B.avl,B.atP,B.eI,B.eW,B.df,B.dH],t.q)
B.asR=new A.f("where","Where were you around 11 last night?","Out in the greenhouse 'til midnight, coverin' the strawberries against the frost. Came up to the house the once, about eleven, after me tea flask, but the door was latched so I went back. Penny let me in at midnight.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.asC=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","That Colonel owes her a packet, and Miss Tira gets the lot. Take your pick, guv.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.avT=new A.f("window","Penny says she never left her oven.","Does she? When I came up at eleven I looked in the kitchen window, hopin' she'd pass me flask out. Lamp lit, oven dark, no Penny. I stood there a good five minutes. Thought she'd gone to bed.",B.b,B.tB,null)
B.avB=new A.f("coal","The kitchen coal scuttle is still full.","'Course it is, I filled it at six like every evenin'. If it's still full this mornin', nobody's fired that oven. An hour's bakin' burns half of it.",B.tX,B.b,null)
B.WJ=s(["penny/oven"],t.s)
B.au8=new A.f("leftover","Penny says she had coal left from the day before.","Not a lump, guv. She was scrapin' the bottom when I filled it \u2014 said so herself, and none too kindly.",B.b,B.WJ,null)
B.WB=s([B.asR,B.di,B.asC,B.avT,B.avB,B.au8,B.dF,B.dm,B.dI,B.dt,B.dw,B.du,B.eL],t.q)
