B.Pk=new A.r("prints","Prints on the Sugarloaf","",0,"Two sets of prints came up under the powder. Penny Cotta's are small and neat, around the base. The other is one large hand wrapped right round the narrow end. It is Barry Tart's.",B.aA,B.ar,null,B.f,B.b,!1,"churlock")
