B.asI=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","The niece, sir. Cherchez la heiress! She was on that telephone half the night, and who is to say what she was arranging?",B.b,B.b,null)
B.nr=s(["graham/dog"],t.s)
B.auh=new A.f("bark","When did the dog bark last night?","Twenty to eleven, sir, on the dot. Put me clean off my gambit. Yapped for a minute and stopped. At midnight? Silent as the grave. We were packing up the pieces. I'd have heard.",B.b,B.nr,null)
B.a_i=s([B.iR,B.iN,B.asI,B.auh,B.h3,B.h_,B.dg,B.dj,B.dh,B.eK],t.q)
B.avd=new A.f("bark","When did the dog bark last night?","Once, darling, at twenty to eleven. I remember because I was about to ring Madame Leine and had to wait for the little beast to stop. Not a yap after that, and I was awake until one.",B.b,B.nr,null)
B.arF=new A.f("chess","Could you hear the chess players?","The Colonel roars \u201ccheck\u201d as if he were ordering a charge, darling. Every few minutes, all the way to midnight. And Graham sighing in between.",B.d8,B.b,null)
B.a37=s([B.fZ,B.eO,B.p2,B.avd,B.arF,B.eI,B.eW,B.df,B.dH],t.q)
B.auJ=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","That niece, guv. She'll have the lot now, won't she. And the Colonel owes more than he's worth.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.a0G=s(["mudprint"],t.s)
B.awp=new A.f("mud","Your heel print is in the custard.","I'm through that cellar ten times a day to get to me boiler, guv. Must've trod there this mornin', in all the fuss.",B.a0G,B.b,null)
B.a1X=s(["seedglaze"],t.s)
B.arJ=new A.f("glaze",u.a,"I'm through that cellar ten times a day to get to me boiler, guv. I shed seeds like a dog sheds hair. That'll be from this mornin'.",B.a1X,B.b,null)
B.awe=new A.f("prints","Your hand is round the end of the sugarloaf.","Carried the shoppin' in for Penny, didn't I. Tuesday. She can't lift a full loaf with them wrists. Ask her.",B.aa,B.b,null)
B.avV=new A.f("knock","Nobody heard you knock at midnight. Not even the dog.","I knocked soft, guv. Didn't want to wake the house. And the dog knows me. He don't bark at me.",B.b,B.nr,null)
B.Y6=s(["tira/bark"],t.s)
B.avb=new A.f("barked","The dog barked at twenty to eleven.","Fox, most likely. Or the rain. He barks at the rain. I was in the greenhouse, guv, I told you.",B.b,B.Y6,null)
B.asK=new A.f("teagarden","You and Penny have paid a deposit on a tea garden.","A fella can dream, can't he? Me on the beddin' plants, her on the scones. Never would've come to nothin'.",B.tH,B.b,null)
