B.PN=new A.r("glasses","Brandy Glasses","parlor",2,"Two brandy glasses beside the chessboard. One is clean and dry. The other has a sticky purple film in the bottom, with tiny blue-black seeds in it. It smells of the nursery.",B.t9,B.qh,null,B.f,B.b,!1,null)
B.Q8=new A.r("planner","Appointment Book","study",0,"Mrs. Senclair's appointment book, kept under lock. Today's page: \u201c9 AM, Mr. Abacus, the auditor. Thirty years of household books. G. to give up his keys at breakfast.\u201d",B.bG,B.u,"desk",B.f,B.b,!1,null)
