B.Na=new A.r("passbook","Bank Passbook","groom",2,"Under the mattress of his bed: a bank passbook in the name of G. Cracker. A deposit every Friday for thirty years, each for the same small sum. The total is 31,000 sugar cubes. A butler's wage would not come to half of it.",B.QL,B.u,null,B.f,B.b,!1,null)
