B.auK=new A.f("smear","Is this smear your cocoa?","Darling, look at me. I am dusted. I am not iced. That is icing, chocolate icing, the kind that drips. Nobody who lives in this house is made of that.",B.Zx,B.b,null)
B.arz=new A.f("footsteps","Did anyone pass you on the landing?","Somebody came down from the storage nook just as I picked up the telephone, darling. In slippers. I took it for Graham and didn't turn round. But Graham was at chess, wasn't he?",B.fC,B.b,null)
