B.NE=new A.r("oldwill","Farmer Kernel's Will","office",2,"On the farmer's desk, a copy of his will, dog-eared: \u201cThe farm, the corn and the cows to my daughter, Lolly.\u201d The cows are underlined.",B.aR,B.m,null,B.f,B.b,!1,null)
