B.a5t=new A.ar(B.a7y,[u.Q,u.Q,"Splendid. Now all we want is the weapon.",u.F,u.C,u.S,u.o,"Heavy, and round, and gone. Who in this house dusts that shelf, and who sits by it?","The night of the harvest moon was a Wednesday, then. Remember that, the next time anybody shows you a date.","A machine that counts, at a rate written on the side. That is the farmhand placed, I should say.","Friday, and the University. So somebody at the University was about to have a very bad Friday.","Bone dry, in a night of rain. Who told us they came home soaked to the stick?","Spotless, in a night of rain and mud. Who told us they came home soaked to the stick?","On top of the corn, so after he fell. Marsha knows every dessert in this house. Ask her whose that is.","On top of the corn, so after he fell. Marsha knows every dessert in this house. Ask her who walks like that.","Hidden in a hurry, by somebody who knew the dark corners. I should dust it.",u.I,"A man about to be shown up as a thief. That is a motive, and an urgent one. But was he here to act on it?","New labels over old. That is a motive, and an urgent one. But was he here to act on it?","Read every word of it, Churlock, the small print most of all, and then go and look at the kitchen calendar.",u.u],t.w)
B.a2R=s([u.H,"Four of them can be placed by a slip of paper or a machine. One says he was not on the farm at all. Is there anything that proves it?","Look at what was left in the cellar, and at the weapon once it is dusted. Then ask Marsha who it could belong to.","A ticket is only proof if it is the right ticket, old chap. Read the date, look for the guard's punch, and then ask who was on the front-room window at eleven and what they saw."],t.s)
B.eo={butterscotch:0,jellybean:1,marsha:2,gus:3,lolly:4,taffy:5,licorice:6}
B.ari=new A.f("what","What happened to him?","Victim's Cornelius Kernel, the candy corn king. One blow to the back of the head with something round and heavy as a cannonball. Knocked him clean off his tip. We traced where he fell in icing sugar.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.aw3=new A.f("weapon","What was the weapon?","Something round, heavy and hard. Bigger than a fist. It isn't down here.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.eF=new A.f("home","Who was on the farm last night?","The five who live here, Detective, and nobody else: the gate was chained at ten and the dogs from Nougat's place would have raised the county. One of them did this \u2014 or two of them together. Mind you, they've all got a reason, and most of the mess round here is just a farm being a farm.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.nz=s(["gus/where"],t.s)
B.iO=new A.f("creamery","Can the creamery man vouch for Gus?","I rang them first thing. Fudge, the driver, says Gus handed him four churns at the barn door on the stroke of eleven and talked his ear off about tractors.",B.b,B.nz,null)
B.PE=new A.r("fchart","Fingerprint Card","",0,"A card from the Candy Land Constabulary with the fingerprints of all five on the farm, taken this morning. With it I can dust the murder weapon and see who has handled it.",B.aA,B.ar,null,B.f,B.b,!1,"butterscotch")
B.eN=new A.f("chart","May I borrow your fingerprint card?","Take it. We printed all five of them at breakfast and the farmhand nearly pulled my arm off shaking hands after. Find the weapon, dust it, and see whose prints come up. A print tells you who touched a thing. It doesn't tell you when.",B.b,B.b,B.PE)
B.Wa=s([B.ari,B.aw3,B.eF,B.iO,B.eN],t.q)
B.oZ=new A.f("when","When did he die?","Cold as a cucumber when we got here at seven, sir. Some time round eleven last night, the Sheriff says. Find something that pins it down and you'll beat us to it.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.oX=new A.f("found","Who found him?","Miss Mallow, the cook, at six, when she came down for potatoes. She rang the exchange from the front room and they rang us. She's been baking ever since. We've had nine scones each.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.p_=new A.f("advice","Any advice, Deputy?","The Sheriff says never believe an alibi till something else backs it up, sir. A slip, a clock, somebody with no reason to lie. And when one of them tells you a thing, go and put it to the others.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.tS=s(["licorice/where"],t.s)
B.avq=new A.f("train","Did the Professor come in on the last train?","The station master says nobody got off at Kernel Halt last night at all, sir. Not a soul. He waited in the rain to wave at them, and he's cross about it.",B.b,B.tS,null)
B.tC=s([B.oZ,B.oX,B.p_,B.avq],t.q)
B.h1=new A.f("where","Where were you around 11 last night?","In my kitchen from half past ten till half past eleven, turning my Harvest Moon Pie every three minutes, or it catches on the one side. Then I went up to bed. I didn't go down to the cellar till six.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.arv=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Gruff, and a bit of a crust on him, but soft in the middle. He'd taken against the Professor this week. Wouldn't say why. Ate his pie in the office with the door shut.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.p5=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","I don't like to say it. But Gus has been in a black mood since Sunday's card game, and he's strong as an ox.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.uc=s(["umbrella","spats"],t.s)
B.awf=new A.f("umbrella","The Professor's umbrella is dry.","Is it? It was in the stand when I locked up at nine, I remember, because I thought: he'll get drenched in town without it. And I never heard him come in at all. I'd left the pie out.",B.uc,B.b,null)
B.YQ=s(["aniseed","stilts"],t.s)
B.as1=new A.f("trace","Whose is this, left by the body?","Liquorice. Black liquorice, and long legs like a heron's. That's the Professor and nobody else on this farm. But he was in town, wasn't he?",B.YQ,B.b,null)
B.arH=new A.f("pie","Did the Professor eat his pie?","Not a crumb. It was there on the sill at six, cold. That's not like him. He'd eat a pie in his sleep.",B.b,B.tS,null)
B.tP=s(["harvestpie"],t.s)
B.Pg=new A.r("bakecard","Bake Card","",0,"Marsha's bake card for last night, in pencil: \u201cHarvest Moon Pie. IN 10:30. Turned every 3 minutes. OUT 11:30. Not a scorch on her.\u201d",B.aR,B.u,null,B.f,B.b,!1,"marsha")
B.h0=new A.f("card","May I see your bake card?","Of course you may, dear. I write up every bake. I've nothing to hide but a very good pastry.",B.tP,B.b,B.Pg)
B.a_I=s(["honeyjar"],t.s)
B.eX=new A.f("honey","There is honey all over your floor.","That was me, this morning, when I found him. I came in from the yard like a bolting rabbit and knocked the jar flying. I've not had the heart to mop it.",B.a_I,B.b,null)
B.a_J=s(["hotelletter"],t.s)
B.eV=new A.f("hotel","The Grand Sugar Hotel has offered you a post.","Three weeks ago, and I've been carrying that letter about like a hot coal. I wasn't going to take it. Who'd turn the Professor's pie?",B.a_J,B.b,null)
B.a2P=s([B.h1,B.arv,B.p5,B.awf,B.as1,B.arH,B.h0,B.eX,B.eV],t.q)
B.eS=new A.f("where","Where were you around 11 last night?","In the barn, milking. Eleven o'clock every night, rain or shine, and the creamery man takes the churns from me at the barn door. Then I bedded down in the loft.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.atO=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Best farmer in Candy Land, and knew it. Took my wages back off me at cards every Sunday for twenty years. I'd do it all again.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.awY=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","The city folk. The Professor, if you ask me, with his little packets and his locked cabinet. I saw his lamp burning at half past ten from the barn. Thought he'd left it on.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.a2r=s(["uniletter","seedtags","fplanner"],t.s)
B.awO=new A.f("seed","Somebody took seed from the farmer's chest.","The rainbow seed. Kernel bred that himself, ten years in the back field. He found the chest half empty on Sunday and nearly had a seizure. Said he knew who.",B.a2r,B.b,null)
B.Zd=s(["cinnamonfork"],t.s)
B.eT=new A.f("fork","What is that on your pitchfork?","Cinnamon, Detective. I mucked out the red-hot pigs yesterday. Lick it if you don't believe me. ...Wouldn't, though. Burns.",B.Zd,B.b,null)
B.a1y=s(["raffle"],t.s)
B.eA=new A.f("raffle","Fifty raffle tickets, all in your name.","A tractor, Detective. A red one. I've wanted a tractor since I was a seedling. A man's allowed one weakness.",B.a1y,B.b,null)
B.Z7=s(["cards"],t.s)
B.ez=new A.f("cards","Somebody has marked the aces.","The Farmer did that himself. Every Sunday for twenty years he took my wages back off me at cards, and every Sunday I let him. You don't tell a man that age you know.",B.Z7,B.b,null)
B.a0d=s([B.eS,B.atO,B.awY,B.awO,B.eT,B.eA,B.ez],t.q)
B.h2=new A.f("where","Where were you around 11 last night?","On the telephone in the front room, from ten to eleven till half past, with the Talent Bureau in Candy City. They do auditions down the line at night. I sang the whole of \u201cSweet on the City\u201d. Twice.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.auj=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Daddy? Stubborn as a stalk. He wanted me on the farm and I wanted the city. We fought about it every single day, and I'd give anything for one more fight.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.atv=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Taffy, I suppose. He's strong enough to lift a cow, and Daddy docked his wages. ...No. Not Taffy. I don't know.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.i5=s(["partyline"],t.s)
B.awF=new A.f("footsteps","Did you see anything from the front room?","Nobody came through. But at eleven I saw the greenhouse lamp go out, and a little light come bobbing across the orchard toward the yard, on two long thin legs. I thought it was a heron. We haven't got herons.",B.i5,B.b,null)
B.atJ=new A.f("myprints","Your fingerprints are on the gobstopper.","I dust that shelf every Sunday. It's my one chore. Daddy said a girl who wants to be a star can start by polishing his.",B.aa,B.b,null)
B.Z1=s(["bigsugar"],t.s)
B.eB=new A.f("bigsugar","Big Sugar want to buy the farm from you.","They write every month. They want it for a factory. I'd sell it to them tomorrow and take the train to the city, and Daddy knew it. But it was never mine to sell.",B.Z1,B.b,null)
B.a0Z=s(["oldwill"],t.s)
B.eR=new A.f("will","The will leaves everything to you.","And the cows. Especially the cows. He changed it every time we quarrelled, and changed it back the next Sunday. Ask Gus.",B.a0Z,B.b,null)
B.Zi=s(["contest"],t.s)
B.eM=new A.f("contest","Your contest fee is overdue.","Everything I have is overdue, darling. That's what it is to be an artist on a farm.",B.Zi,B.b,null)
B.a0w=s(["lollydiary"],t.s)
B.eH=new A.f("diary","Your diary says the city will chew you up.","He said it, I wrote it down. That's not a motive, that's a lyric.",B.a0w,B.b,null)
