B.aum=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Fair man. Hard, but fair. Docked me when I broke things, paid me when I didn't. I break a lot of things.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.p4=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Couldn't say. I was crankin'. You don't look up when you're crankin'.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.a0x=s(["lovepoem"],t.s)
B.eP=new A.f("poem","Who is the poem for?","That's private. ...It's for Miss Lolly. She don't know. She's goin' to the city, and I'm stayin' here with the corn. That's how it is.",B.a0x,B.b,null)
B.a2E=s(["wagesdocked"],t.s)
B.eE=new A.f("wages","The Farmer docked your wages.","Handle snapped off in my hand. Third time. I'm strong, Detective. I don't know my own strength. He docked me a week and I said fair enough. It was fair enough.",B.a2E,B.b,null)
B.a0j=s([B.iQ,B.aum,B.p4,B.eP,B.eE],t.q)
B.eJ=new A.f("where","Where were you around 11 last night?","In Candy City, at the University, until the last train. I came in at ten to twelve, soaked to the stick, and went straight to my cot in the greenhouse. Marsha had left a pie out. I didn't touch it. I was too tired.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.arQ=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","A brilliant farmer and an impossible man. We disagreed about everything, from crossing to kernels. I shall miss our arguments.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.FP=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Statistically, Detective, the foreman. They always have keys to everything, and grudges to match.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.Oc=new A.r("ticket","Railway Ticket","",0,"The Professor's ticket: \u201cCandy Line Railway. Candy City to Kernel Halt. Last train, 11:20 PM. Thursday the 14th.\u201d The card is crisp, and nobody has punched it.",B.i0,B.u,null,B.f,B.b,!1,"licorice")
B.arq=new A.f("proof","Can you prove you came home on the last train?","Naturally. I keep my tickets: one never knows when one will be asked to account for one's movements by a churro. Here.",B.b,B.b,B.Oc)
B.at8=new A.f("umbrella","Your umbrella never left the porch.","I bought another in town. A cheap one. It turned inside out at the station and I threw it in a hedge. ...A large hedge.",B.uc,B.b,null)
B.UT=s(["jellybean/train"],t.s)
B.FR=new A.f("station","Nobody got off the last train at Kernel Halt.","The station master is a short-sighted gumball with a grudge. I got off at the far end of the platform. In the dark.",B.b,B.UT,null)
B.V1=s(["lolly/footsteps"],t.s)
B.aws=new A.f("door","Lolly saw your light cross the orchard at eleven.","The greenhouse lamp is on a clockwork timer, for the seedlings. And Miss Popwell sees whatever makes the better song.",B.b,B.V1,null)
B.a2q=s(["uniletter","seedtags"],t.s)
B.awx=new A.f("seed","Your rainbow corn is grown from his seed.","Seed is seed, Detective. What matters is what one does with it. He grew candy corn. I was going to change the world.",B.a2q,B.b,null)
B.atu=new A.f("myprints","Your fingerprints are on the gobstopper.","I examined it on Sunday. A remarkable example of concentric crystallisation. I am a scientist. I touch things.",B.aa,B.b,null)
B.a0p=s(["licoricelace"],t.s)
B.eU=new A.f("lace","Your liquorice is all over the Farmer's chair.","I read in that chair every evening while he did the accounts. We argued about corn. He was wrong about everything and I shall miss him terribly.",B.a0p,B.b,null)
B.a2G=s(["weedkiller"],t.s)
B.eY=new A.f("poison","You keep a bottle of poison.","Weedkiller, for the aphids in my seed trays. If I wished to poison anyone, Detective, I should hardly label the bottle with a skull.",B.a2G,B.b,null)
