B.a5U=new A.dp("fmoon","Under the Harvest Moon",B.ak0,B.a_P,B.Xp,B.eb,10,B.akp,B.OZ,B.a0t,"1871",B.a5t,B.a2R,B.ai,B.bf,B.ai,B.a5k,"Farmer Kernel had found out that Professor Licorice's famous rainbow corn was grown from seed stolen out of the Kernel seed chest, and he meant to go to the University on Friday and say so. The Professor said he spent the evening in Candy City and came home on the last train. In fact he came home at six, kept to his room, and at eleven crept out of the greenhouse with the Giant Gobstopper from the trophy shelf. At 11:05 he struck the farmer with it in the root cellar, and hid it. The ticket he showed was for the next day's train, and the guard had never punched it. His umbrella had stood dry on the porch since nine, and Lolly, at the front-room telephone, saw his light cross the orchard at eleven. Marsha was at her pie, Taffy at the puller, and Gus at the barn door with the creamery man.",B.a0z)
