B.Nn=new A.r("glassytaffy","Last Night's Taffy","pressroom",2,"Last night's batch of taffy, cooling on the slab. It is hard and glassy right through, and rings when it is tapped.",B.jX,B.aP,null,B.f,B.b,!1,null)
