B.NY=new A.r("ring","Ring Box","frontroom",0,"At the back of Lolly's dressing-table drawer, a little velvet box. In it, a ring twisted out of pink sugar, and a card: \u201cTo L. from T. When we are free.\u201d",B.k5,B.bv,"vanity",B.f,B.b,!1,null)
B.PH=new A.r("dismissal","Notice of Dismissal","office",0,"In the rolltop, in the farmer's hand: \u201cT. Pulman to be paid off Saturday and off the farm by Sunday. My daughter will not marry a farmhand while I draw breath.\u201d",B.aB,B.u,"rolltop",B.f,B.b,!1,null)
