B.axa=new A.f("line","Was the telephone line down last night?","Down, sir? No. Miss Mallow rang the exchange on it at six this morning, and the exchange says there was nothing wrong with it all night. No calls, though. Not a single one.",B.b,B.YS,null)
B.Wz=s([B.oZ,B.oX,B.p_,B.axa],t.q)
B.atn=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Gruff, and a bit of a crust on him, but soft in the middle. He'd been shouting at Miss Lolly all week. Doors slamming. I turned the wireless up.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.p0=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","I don't like to say it. But the Professor's been sly lately, creeping about with his packets.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.tM=s(["glassytaffy"],t.s)
B.avJ=new A.f("glassy","Why would taffy come out hard as glass?","Because nobody's hands were on it, dear. Taffy wants pulling by hand: the warmth keeps it soft. Pull it cold, by a machine, and it goes like a windowpane.",B.tM,B.b,null)
B.a1f=s(["pinkstrand","twosets"],t.s)
B.arN=new A.f("trace","Whose is this, left on the steps?","Pink. Pink, and sticky, and a splinter of stripe. That's Taffy and Miss Lolly, both of them. Oh, dear. Oh, dear oh dear.",B.a1f,B.b,null)
