B.ax0=new A.f("belt","Did you see anything odd on your way back from the gate?","Now you ask. The windmill belt was running in through the press room window. Never seen that before. It's for the pump, that belt. I thought Taffy'd found a new way to be lazy.",B.b,B.to,null)
B.a1J=s(["rockbarrel"],t.s)
B.atZ=new A.f("barrels","Who moves the barrels in the cellar?","Me. Nobody else is let. That rock candy weighs as much as a cow. It takes two to lift it and I've never needed two.",B.a1J,B.b,null)
B.avj=new A.f("myprints","Your fingerprints are on the barrel.","All over it, I should hope. I stacked it. I stack them all.",B.aa,B.b,null)
