B.FN=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Daddy? Stubborn as a stalk. He wanted me on the farm and I wanted the city. We fought about it every day.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.FO=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Gus. Daddy took his wages every Sunday for twenty years. Nobody takes that for twenty years.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.awP=new A.f("phone","Weren't you on the telephone last night?","Not last night. The line was down, with the storm. So I went to watch Taffy. There was nothing else to do.",B.b,B.b,null)
