B.a5u=new A.ar(B.a6K,[u.Q,u.Q,"Splendid. Now all we want is the weapon.",u.F,u.C,u.S,u.o,u.d,u._,"Sold on the first. A cow that is not here cannot be milked. Remember her name.","Tell G.G. after, not before. So somebody was not supposed to know what was coming. I wonder if he did.","Chalked at twenty-five past ten. And the slip says eleven. One of them is wrong. Ask the Sheriff which.","Full to bursting. Who told us they milked these cows at eleven o'clock?",u.T,"Hidden up a ladder that has gone missing. Whose bed is in that loft? I should dust it.","He cheated. Somebody has carried that for forty years, Churlock.","The farm, the corn and the cows, and one name left off the list.","Not the farmer's. Marsha knows every dessert on this farm. Ask her whose sugar that is.","Hay, in the cellar. Marsha knows every boot on this farm. Ask her whose that is.","Read the names, old chap. Every cow on that card ought to be standing in the barn.",u.u],t.w)
B.YB=s([u.H,"Every one of the five has an alibi on paper. Which of those papers was written by somebody who actually saw them?","Go to the gate and look at the churn stand, and then go and listen to the cows.","A slip that says eleven out of habit, a card that names a cow sold last month, and a churn with a dent in the rim. Name him."],t.s)
