B.atB=new A.f("weapon","What was the weapon?","Heavy, iron, with a rim to it. There's milk splashed on the potatoes, Detective. Make of that what you will.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.arh=new A.f("creamery","Can the creamery man vouch for Gus?","Funny you should ask. I rang them. Fudge says he never goes up to the barn, not in twenty years: he takes the churns off the stand at the gate at half past ten, and leaves a slip in an empty one. Writes eleven on all of them. Habit.",B.b,B.nz,null)
