B.as6=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Gruff, and a bit of a crust on him, but soft in the middle. He'd had a man from Big Sugar in the office on Sunday. Came out looking ten years older.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.auI=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","I don't like to say it. But Miss Lolly wanted the farm sold more than anything in the world.",B.b,B.b,null)
