B.axc=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Daddy? Stubborn as a stalk. He wanted me on the farm and I wanted the city. And then on Sunday he said he'd sell it anyway, to Big Sugar, and go and live by the sea. I laughed. I couldn't help it.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.au_=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Not Gus. Gus is like a big green uncle. Somebody from outside, it must have been.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.awD=new A.f("cows","Did you hear anything from the barn?","The cows, all night, bellowing like a brass band. I had to put a finger in my other ear to hear the Talent Bureau. Gus usually milks them quiet by eleven.",B.i5,B.b,null)
