B.atQ=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","A brilliant farmer and an impossible man. He was going to sell the whole farm to a factory. I told him it was a crime against corn.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.ary=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","I was on a train, Detective. But if you want a scientist's opinion: look at whoever stood to lose the most.",B.b,B.b,null)
