B.a4O=new A.ar(B.a7r,[u.Q,u.Q,"Splendid. Now all we want is the weapon.",u.F,u.C,"Burnt on one side, Churlock. A pie that must be turned every three minutes went a good while without it. Who was supposed to be turning it?",u.d,"Leaves at twenty past eleven, arrives twelve minutes to midnight. Remember that the next time anybody tells you when a train came in.","Read every word of it, old chap. A guard punches a ticket when it is used.","Heavy, and iron, and gone from the cook's own wall.","Two forks, Churlock. Somebody had company over pie, and one of them leaves a black smear.","Two slices, and a liquorice hair in one. Who was eating pie with the cook at midnight?",u.T,"Sunk in the syrup, by somebody who hoped it would stay there. I should dust it.","Two sets of initials, and half each. That is a partnership, old chap.","Two notes in two hands on one packet. That is a partnership, old chap.","Flour, and liquorice, side by side on top of the corn.","Two trails, side by side, of two very different feet.","Read it line by line against the timetable on the porch, Churlock.",u.u],t.w)
B.Yt=s([u.H,"Three of them are placed by a telephone slip, a creamery slip and a machine. The other two are placed by a pie and a train. Look at both of those very hard.","The pie was burnt, and the ticket was never punched. And somebody ate pie with the cook before midnight.","Read Marsha's bake card against the timetable by the front door. A train cannot arrive the minute it leaves. Name them both."],t.s)
B.avK=new A.f("what","What happened to him?","Victim's Cornelius Kernel, the candy corn king. One flat, heavy blow to the back of the head. Something with a handle, I'd say. We traced where he fell in icing sugar.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.asf=new A.f("weapon","What was the weapon?","Flat, heavy, iron, with a handle. A spade, maybe. Or a pan. It isn't down here.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.WE=s([B.avK,B.asf,B.eF,B.iO,B.eN],t.q)
B.auO=new A.f("where","Where were you around 11 last night?","In my kitchen from half past ten till half past eleven, turning my Harvest Moon Pie every three minutes. The Professor came in off the train at twenty past and I gave him a slice. Then I went to bed.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.arD=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Gruff, and a bit of a crust on him. He'd been through my recipe box on Monday. Said he was looking for scones. He wasn't.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.awC=new A.f("burnt","Your pie is burnt on one side.","Oh! Is it? I... I must have been talking. The Professor came in and I was cutting his slice, and I forgot it. Just the once.",B.tP,B.b,null)
B.Qi=new A.r("bakecard","Bake Card","",0,"Marsha's bake card for last night, in pencil: \u201cHarvest Moon Pie. IN 10:30. Turned every 3 minutes. 11:20, the Professor in off the last train, cut him a slice. OUT 11:30.\u201d",B.aR,B.u,null,B.f,B.b,!1,"marsha")
B.avF=new A.f("card","May I see your bake card?","Of course you may, dear. I write up every bake. There. It's all there.",B.b,B.b,B.Qi)
B.u1=s(["recipesale","seedbig"],t.s)
B.au3=new A.f("big","You sold the farm recipe to Big Sugar.","It was my recipe as much as his! Thirty years I've made his corn taste of something. He never paid me a cube for it.",B.u1,B.b,null)
B.atb=new A.f("myprints","Your fingerprints are on the skillet.","It's my skillet, dear. I fry his breakfast in it every morning of my life.",B.aa,B.b,null)
B.a0e=s([B.auO,B.arD,B.p5,B.awC,B.avF,B.au3,B.atb,B.eX,B.eV],t.q)
B.avX=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Best farmer in Candy Land, and knew it. He'd caught somebody selling his secrets, he told me on Sunday. Wouldn't say who. Said he'd be at the post office Friday.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.avU=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","City folk. I saw the Professor's lamp burning at half past ten, from the barn. Thought he'd left it on.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.a19=s([B.eS,B.avX,B.avU,B.eT,B.eA,B.ez],t.q)
B.auE=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Daddy? Stubborn as a stalk. He was in a fury on Monday about his recipe. Kept saying he'd been robbed from inside his own house.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.asF=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Gus, I suppose. Daddy took his wages every Sunday for twenty years.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.at_=new A.f("smell","Did you notice anything from the front room?","Burning. At quarter past eleven, burning pie, through the kitchen door. Marsha never burns anything. And two voices out in the yard, very low, going down.",B.i5,B.b,null)
B.YU=s([B.h2,B.auE,B.asF,B.at_,B.eB,B.eR,B.eM,B.eH],t.q)
B.arO=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Fair man. Hard, but fair. Docked me when I broke things.",B.b,B.b,null)
