B.a55=new A.ar(B.a6N,[u.Q,u.Q,"Splendid. Now all we want is the weapon.",u.F,u.C,u.S,u.o,"Pulled from the barn, Churlock, and it fell in the cellar. Nobody had to be anywhere near him. Dust it.","All at once, from above. Who works the chute, and who could see down it?","The key to the chute, marked for the foreman, in the cook's recipe box. Two people, one key.",u.d,u._,"Signed M., and sending him to stand exactly under the chute. I should look at what goes into that pie.","No potatoes, Churlock. So what was anybody doing fetching potatoes for it?","Two names, one fund, and a word written across it. That is a motive for two.","Two of them counting on it for twenty years. That is a motive for two.","Where does it say the key was? And where did we find it?",u.u],t.w)
B.XJ=s(["Before you name anyone, Churlock: do we know how he died, and from where? Find out what came down on him.","Every one of the five has an alibi, and I believe all five. So ask who did not need to be in the cellar at all.","Somebody sent him to stand in one particular spot, and somebody held the key to what came down on it. Look for a note, and a key.","A note signed M., a key in the cook's box, and a lever with the foreman's hand round it. Name them both."],t.s)
B.asV=new A.f("what","What happened to him?","Victim's Cornelius Kernel, the candy corn king. Buried, Detective. A ton of his own corn came down the chute on top of him. We had to dig to find the outline.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.av2=new A.f("weapon","Could it have been an accident?","That chute's padlocked at the barn end. Has been since Monday, when Taffy jammed it. Somebody unlocked it and pulled the lever. From the barn, mind. Not from down here.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.arT=new A.f("creamery","Can the creamery man vouch for Gus?","I rang them first thing. Fudge, the driver, says Gus handed him four churns at the barn door on the stroke of eleven, and was still standing in the doorway when the cart pulled away at two minutes past.",B.b,B.nz,null)
B.a2N=s([B.asV,B.av2,B.eF,B.arT,B.eN],t.q)
B.asr=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Gruff, and a bit of a crust on him. Thirty years I cooked for that man. Thirty years, and what had I to show for it but a promise?",B.b,B.b,null)
