B.a4J=new A.ar(B.a6V,[u.Q,u.Q,"Splendid. Now all we want is the weapon.",u.F,u.S,u.o,"Heavy, and brass, and kept by the front door, where anybody going out across the yard would pass it.",u.d,u._,"The line never dropped, it says. It does not say where the receiver was. Ask somebody who was listening at the other end.","A telephone that can walk, Churlock. Where would forty feet of cable reach from that table?","Something long and thin dragged up and down the cellar steps last night. Not a body. A cable.",u.T,u.I,"Everything to the Society. Somebody lost a farm last week, and may only just have found out.","Over my dead body. A father should be careful what he writes.","Pink and white stripes, on top of the corn. Marsha knows every dessert on this farm. Ask her.","Somebody who stands on a stick. Marsha knows every dessert on this farm. Ask her.","Compare it with what the Sheriff heard from the Bureau itself. And look at the ink.",u.u],t.w)
B.U_=s([u.H,"Every one of the five has an alibi on paper. One of them is a telephone line. A line can be long.","Look under the telephone table, and at the cellar steps. Then ask the Sheriff to ring the other end of that call.","Two minutes of silence in the middle of a song, a cord that reaches the cellar, and a doorstop with a fresh hand round it. Name her."],t.s)
B.avR=new A.f("what","What happened to him?","Victim's Cornelius Kernel, the candy corn king. One blow with something heavy and pointed. It went through his white stripe. We traced where he fell in icing sugar.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.avz=new A.f("weapon","What was the weapon?","Heavy, metal, pointed, about the size of a loaf. It isn't down here.",B.b,B.b,null)
