B.aui=new A.f("bureau","Can the Talent Bureau vouch for Lolly?","I rang them. Their man says she sang beautifully, the whole of \u201cSweet on the City\u201d twice. Except that at four minutes past eleven she stopped dead, in the middle of a high note, for two minutes, and came back puffing like a train. He's marked her down for breath.",B.b,B.Yf,null)
