B.a58=new A.ar(B.a6E,[u.Q,u.Q,"Splendid. Now all we want is the weapon.",u.F,u.C,u.S,u.o,"A machine that counts. But it does not say when it was turned, old chap. Only how often.","No handle, no cranking. So who has been turning it, and when?",u._,"Hidden in the syrup, by somebody at home in that room. I should dust it.","Hidden in the barn, a long way from the machine it came off. I should dust it.","Cold and dusty. Marsha knows taffy. Ask her how long that has been sitting.","Full. So the machine went unoiled last night. Ask the house whether it heard it squeal.","Kernel sugar, sold under another name. That is a motive, and an urgent one.","The Sheriff, Friday. Somebody's Friday was going to be very unpleasant.","Pink, and stretched. Marsha knows every dessert on this farm. Ask her.","Somebody who stretches. Marsha knows every dessert on this farm. Ask her.","Warm as toast at midnight, it says. Go and feel the batch, Churlock.",u.u],t.w)
B.Wg=s([u.H,"Every one of the five has an alibi, and one of them is a machine. A counter says how much, not when.","Look at the side of the puller, and at the batch on the slab. Then ask the house whether the puller squealed last night.","A machine with no handle, a batch pulled hours early, and a crank with a fresh hand round it. Name him."],t.s)
B.as7=new A.f("what","What happened to him?","Victim's Cornelius Kernel, the candy corn king. One blow with something iron, bent, with a knob on the end. We traced where he fell in icing sugar.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.asc=new A.f("weapon","What was the weapon?","Iron, bent like an elbow, a knob on one end and a square on the other. It isn't down here.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.XP=s([B.as7,B.asc,B.eF,B.iO,B.eN],t.q)
B.awt=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Gruff, and a bit of a crust on him. He'd been counting the sugar sacks all week. Said the sugar was walking.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.ZA=s(["dustybatch"],t.s)
B.at7=new A.f("fresh","How long has that taffy been sitting?","Hours, dear. Fresh pulled taffy's warm for an hour and soft till morning. That's cold right through, and dusty. That was pulled before supper.",B.ZA,B.b,null)
B.a1g=s(["pinkthumb","stretchsteps"],t.s)
B.awJ=new A.f("trace","Whose is this, left on the steps?","Pink, and stretched. That's Taffy. Nobody else on this farm stretches. Oh, the poor lamb.",B.a1g,B.b,null)
B.X6=s([B.h1,B.awt,B.p0,B.at7,B.awJ,B.h0,B.eX,B.eV],t.q)
B.atX=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Best farmer in Candy Land, and knew it. He'd found Taffy's taffy on a stall at the fair. Came home purple.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.arn=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Can't say. I was at the barn door from eleven.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.atV=new A.f("quiet","Did you hear the puller last night?","No, and I'll tell you a thing: I always do. It squeals like a pig all the way across the yard. Last night, quiet as a church.",B.b,B.to,null)
B.ave=new A.f("myprints",u.Z,"I fit a new handle on that machine every spring when Taffy snaps the old one. Did it in April.",B.aa,B.b,null)
B.VC=s([B.eS,B.atX,B.arn,B.atV,B.ave,B.eT,B.eA,B.ez],t.q)
B.au1=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Daddy? Stubborn as a stalk. He was in a temper about the fair all week. Something about stripes.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.arx=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Not Taffy. Taffy's sweet. ...I don't know.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.atr=new A.f("squeak","Could you hear the puller from the telephone?","Every night it comes up through the floor, eek-eek-eek, and I have to hum over it. Last night, not a squeak. I sang my whole audition in peace.",B.i5,B.b,null)
B.Zm=s([B.h2,B.au1,B.arx,B.atr,B.eB,B.eR,B.eM,B.eH],t.q)
B.avv=new A.f("where","Where were you around 11 last night?","In the press shed, crankin' the puller, from twenty to eleven till twenty to twelve. Counter'll tell you. 1,190 pulls. Fair hour's work.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.asL=new A.f("about","Tell me about Mrs. Senclair.","Fair man. Hard, but fair. Didn't like me much.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.auY=new A.f("suspect","Who do you suspect?","Gus. Twenty years of losin' at cards. I'd have snapped.",B.b,B.b,null)
B.NF=new A.r("tally","Pull Tally","",0,"Taffy's tally card for last night, in big round letters: \u201cBatch in 10:40. Batch out 11:40. 1,190 pulls with the big crank. Warm as toast at midnight.\u201d",B.aR,B.u,null,B.f,B.b,!1,"taffy")
B.asA=new A.f("tallyask","Did you keep a tally of the pulls?","Always do. Here. Every batch.",B.b,B.b,B.NF)
