B.afR=new A.cd("Farmer Cornelius Kernel has been found dead in his own root cellar. Five others live on the farm. One of them did it. Or two of them, together.","narrator")
B.agK=new A.cd("A long way from home, Watsonut, and a long way from the pavement. Everybody here has a motive, and nobody will confess. I shall search every room and every stall.","churlock")
